      "id": "seal-in-hand",
      "kind": "discovery",
      "title": "The Warden's Seal",
      "prose": "The seal is smaller than expected—tin, tarnished, warm to the touch. Faint inscriptions ring its edge, older than any of the three powers who want it.",
